THIRD-PARTY DATA PROVENANCE & LICENSING NOTICE
================================================================================

This MIT License applies solely to original PsyMix source code, figure-
generation scripts, provenance verification scripts, derived evaluation summary
tables (tables/), and the static client-side identifiability workbench (docs/).

Primary third-party datasets referenced in the accompanying Journal of Chemical
Information and Modeling (JCIM) manuscript—including published botanical and
food databases (Zhuang Materia Medica, 2025 Chinese Pharmacopoeia, FooDB,
FoodAtlas v4.16, FlavorDB, FlavorGraph, USDA FoodData Central, FART,
Uni-Flavor, DmcFlavor) and published human sensory and analytical food panels
spanning Tasks T1–T6 (documented with full citations and DOIs in Table S1 of
the Supporting Information)—are NOT redistributed in this repository. Users
wishing to reconstruct raw primary matrices must obtain those sources directly
from their original publications or repositories under their respective
licensing and citation terms.
